      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET CLARICE (6) has a strong record this track and trip with eight wins and three placings from 12 starts. Was out of the placings last time (30.32) at Cannington in a OPEN, finishing sixth and beaten 8 lengths. Looks suited here and rates on top. ROMFORD (2) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (28.06) from Box 4 at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Can feature again. SUNSET GODDESS (8) had been racing well with a Free For All win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at this track. Expected to do much better this time. STANMORE (1) was below best last time at this track (22.70) in a Free For All, finishing a 5 length fifth. Has already won five times from this draw.",
